      "content": "1|# Free League of Stickyickistan\n2|\n3|The **Free League of Stickyickistan** is the open-table framework for running recurring adventures in [[Mythmos]]. It is built for rotating players, rotating DMs, shared characters, and a setting that grows through play.\n4|\n5|This page contains the core rules for playing in the Free League. For specific resources, use the links below:\n6|\n7|- [[Character Building]]\n8|- [[WANTED! Dungeon Masters]]\n9|- [[DMs Aid]]\n10|- [[The Rolling Papers]]\n11|- [[The Roach Clip]]\n12|- [[FLS & The Loot Tavern]]\n13|- [[FLS & Drakkenheim]]\n14|\n15|Any text with a ~~strikethrough~~ is null.\n16|\n17|View the [wiki commit log](https://github.com/ChaseMilligan/Wikiyickistan/commits/v4/) to see any changes made to the ruleset.\n18|\n19|We will all work together to iteratively build the ruleset.\n20|\n21|# Sources\n22|\n23|Any official or partnered content in D&D Beyond is allowed. Any sources from a third-party must be run past your DM before the PC is playable. I lean very heavily on [[Heliana's Guide to Monster Hunting]], and a small amount of my own homebrew. Other than that I am just using the PHB, DMG, and MM.",
